{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122050/extras/emotes.gif?t=1744723496\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>Welcome to Shadowbox Roulette!</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A mind game of <strong>ragebaiting</strong>, deception, reflexes, and sheer luck? Face off in a tense <strong>1v1</strong> where reading your opponent is the key to survival. But! Losing the <strong>shadowbox</strong> means stepping into <strong>Russian Roulette</strong>, where fates decides your destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122050/extras/How_to_play.png?t=1744723496\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Basically <strong>shadowboxing.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players try to <strong>match the direction with their opponent</strong> either <strong>3</strong> times in a row or just <strong>once</strong>. Each successful match allows the player to fire a roulette shot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Given a lot of freedom, players can actually do whatever they want.</strong>\u00a0</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong></strong></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3122050?t=1744723496","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3122050?t=1744723496","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122050/f2ce95c35b0f30f7aa9c0c338e9f3706d38f0ede/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744723496","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122050/f2ce95c35b0f30f7aa9c0c338e9f3706d38f0ede/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744723496","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Family Sharing","i